s/wiki/Zaoan_Armor_4fa0e1.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot3\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Zaoan Robe\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Zaoan_Robe_0509fd.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot4\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Drakinata\"><img alt=\"Drakinata\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Drakinata_0b5786.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot5\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Lizard%20Trophy\"><img alt=\"Lizard Trophy\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Lizard_Trophy_71b5a2.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">8.54<br/>December 9, 2009<br/>Christmas Update 2009</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Hunting Places <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p>The <b>Zao Palace Antechambers</b> are located below the <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragonblaze%20Peaks\">Dragonblaze Peaks</a> in <a href=\"#/wiki/Zao\">Zao</a>, and can be accessed by going up <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33175,31305,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33175, 31305, 7)</a>. \n</p><p>These antechambers lead into the <a href=\"#/wiki/Zao%20Palace\">Zao Palace</a> through two different entrances: <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33170,31260,10\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">one of these entrances (33170, 31260, 10)</a> can only be accessed as part of a <a href=\"#/quest/the-new-frontier-quest\">quest</a>, and the <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33161,31263,10\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">other (33161, 31263, 10)</a> only after finishing that same quest and sufficiently helping <a href=\"#/wiki/Cael\">Cael</a> the sage in <a href=\"#/quest/tomes-of-knowledge-quest\">his quest (for knowledge)</a>. \n</p><p>The <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33162,31290,10\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">entrance (33162, 31290, 10)</a> to the tower can only be accessed after starting a certain mission of an other <a href=\"#/quest/an-uneasy-alliance-quest\">quest</a>.\n</p><p>A separate antechamber can be found by going down <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33173,31282,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33173, 31282, 7)</a>, but this one doesn't contain any <a href=\"#/wiki/Creatures\">creatures</a> nor does it lead anywhere.\nMission 7 of <a href=\"#/quest/the-new-frontier-quest\">The New Frontier Quest</a> and mission 2 of the Uneasy Alliance Quest take place here. Additionally, there's a <a href=\"#/wiki/Tome%20of%20Knowledge\">Tome of Knowledge</a> (needed for the <a href=\"#/quest/tomes-of-knowledge-quest\">Tomes of Knowledge Quest</a>) located <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33162,31256,10\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33162, 31256, 10)</a>, and another one is located <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33154,31297,3\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33154, 31297, 3)</a>. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Creatures\">Creatures</span></h2>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Creatures in the Zao Palace Antechambers</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Lizard%20Legionnaire\"><img alt=\"Lizard Legionnaire\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Lizard_Legionnaire_830d26.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Lizard%20Legionnaire\">Lizard Legionnaire</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">1,100</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">1,400</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">280 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span></td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>1-165× <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a> (common)</li>\n<li>Broken Halberd (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Strong%20Health%20Potion\">Strong Health Potion</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Bunch%20of%20Ripe%20Rice\">Bunch of Ripe Rice</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>Legionnaire Flags (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Drakinata\">Drakinata</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Lizard%20Leather\">Lizard Leather</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Lizard%20Scale\">Lizard Scale</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Red%20Lantern\">Red Lantern</a> (rare)</li>\n<li>1-2× <a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Diamond\">Small Diamond</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Zaoan%20Halberd\">Zaoan Halberd</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Zaoan%20Shoes\">Zaoan Shoes</a> (very rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Zaoan%20Armor\">Zaoan Armor</a> (very rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Lizard%20Trophy\">Lizard Trophy</a> (very rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Lizard%20Dragon%20Priest\"><img alt=\"Lizard Dragon Priest\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Lizard_Dragon_Priest_602454.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Lizard%20Dragon%20Priest\">Lizard Dragon Priest</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">1,320</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">1,450</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">240, (with summons) 640</td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>0-188× <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a> (common)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Strong%20Mana%20Potion\">Strong Mana Potion</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Great%20Mana%20Potion\">Great Mana Potion</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Dragon Priest's Wandtip (uncommon)</li>\n<li>0-3× <a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Amethyst\">Small Amethyst</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>0-2× <a href=\"#/wiki/Platinum%20Coin\">Platinum Coin</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Wand%20of%20Inferno\">Wand of Inferno</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Yellow%20Gem\">Yellow Gem</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Life%20Ring\">Life Ring</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Terra%20Rod\">Terra Rod</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Lizard%20Leather\">Lizard Leather</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Lizard%20Scale\">Lizard Scale</a> (rare)</li>\n<li>Focus Cape (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Bunch%20of%20Ripe%20Rice\">Bunch of Ripe Rice</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Zaoan%20Shoes\">Zaoan Shoes</a> (rare)</li>\n<li>Zaoan Robe (very rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Lizard%20High%20Guard\"><img alt=\"Lizard High Guard\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Lizard_High_Guard_0b2314.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Lizard%20High%20Guard\">Lizard High Guard</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">1,450</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">1,800</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">370</td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>1-227× <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a> (common)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Great%20Health%20Potion\">Great Health Potion</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li>High Guard Shoulderplates (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Spiked Iron Ball (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Strong%20Health%20Potion\">Strong Health Potion</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li>1-2× <a href=\"#/wiki/Platinum%20Coin\">Platinum Coin</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Bunch%20of%20Ripe%20Rice\">Bunch of Ripe Rice</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>High Guard Flag (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>1-4× <a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Emerald\">Small Emerald</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Red%20Lantern\">Red Lantern</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Lizard%20Leather\">Lizard Leather</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Lizard%20Scale\">Lizard Scale</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Tower%20Shield\">Tower Shield</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Zaoan%20Legs\">Zaoan Legs</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Zaoan%20Shoes\">Zaoan Shoes</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Zaoan%20Armor\">Zaoan Armor</a> (very rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>The tower specifically harbours the following enemies:\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Floor</th>\n<th>Creatures</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>-3</td>\n<td>1 <a href=\"#/wiki/Lizard%20Legionnaire\">Lizard Legionnaire</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>-2</td>\n<td>2 <a href=\"#/wiki/Lizard%20High%20Guard\">Lizard High Guards</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>-1</td>\n<td>1 <a href=\"#/wiki/Lizard%20Legionnaire\">Lizard Legionnaire</a>, 1 <a href=\"#/wiki/Lizard%20High%20Guard\">Lizard High Guard</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>None</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>+1</td>\n<td>1 <a href=\"#/wiki/Lizard%20High%20Guard\">Lizard High Guard</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>+2</td>\n<td>1 <a href=\"#/wiki/Lizard%20Dragon%20Priest\">Lizard Dragon Priest</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>+3</td>\n<td>1 <a href=\"#/wiki/Lizard%20Legionnaire\">Lizard Legionnaire</a>, 1 <a href=\"#/wiki/Lizard%20High%20Guard\">Lizard High Guard</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>+4</td>\n<td>2 <a href=\"#/wiki/Lizard%20High%20Guard\">Lizard High Guards</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Maps\">Maps</span></h2>\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\" data-seq-no=\"0\" hash=\"44dc61434574cb00c3e88bb51b3af393\" id=\"w-gallery-0\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:181px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Zao_Palace_Antechambers_-4-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:112px; width:143px; top:33.5px;\"><img alt=\"Floor +4\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-caption=\"Floor +4\" height=\"113\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Zao_Palace_Antechambers_4_7db245.png\" style=\"\" title=\"Zao Palace Antechambers +4.png (3 KB)\" width=\"143\"/></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" s